    "why": "The paired control for the orchestrated run. One image, one explicit phrase a human chose, the organ called directly with no Director step and no suggestion conversion in the way. Whatever comes back is SAM 3's answer and nothing else's \u2014 which is the only thing that lets a later failure be attributed to the phrase or to the wrapper rather than to the model.\n",
