      "note": "Michelangelo's Piet\u00e0 in situ. Chosen because the wave's prompt is about FOLDS and this is a Renaissance sculpture whose drapery is the most legible thing in the frame \u2014 the robe over Mary's knees carries deep, unambiguous folds a reviewer can check by eye. It is also a hard case in a useful way: the marble is lit against a dark, heavily textured apse, so a mask that wanders into the background is visible immediately rather than plausible.\n"
    },
